  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The expression for induced EMF in the rotating loop in uniform magnetic field is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>NAB</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>The average power loss</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"&#62;\" open=\"&#60;\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"nor